    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "This place used to be a sanctuary. Doctors, nurses\u2026 people trying
        to save lives. Now, it's just another graveyard.\n\nI made it inside, but
        there\u2019s nothing left to save. The soldiers passed through already. They
        took what they needed and left the rest to rot.\n\nI tried to push further
        into the hospital, but my infection has spread too far. My hands won\u2019t
        stop shaking... I can feel myself turning.\n\nThe halls are overrun. There\u2019s
        nothing left here worth saving.\n\nIf you\u2019re reading this\u2026 don\u2019t
        look for me. You already know where to go.\n\nEnd this.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-
        Trevor\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
